msgid "A120_M48A5_hound_TLXXL"
msgstr "Thunderbolt"

msgid "A120_M48A5_hound_TLXXL_descr"
msgstr ""
"The old Thunderbolt. Owns every patch of dirt under it. Power unit was von "
"Krieger's work, bolted in by the man himself. Good work it was, too—still "
"runs like the day it left the bench. Now, every fight, I get to pay him back"
" with his own brilliance. The job used to be simple: stop him, wreck his "
"plan, go home. But this year it's different. He's playing with something he "
"might not be able to put back in the box. Says he can, but I'm not sure he "
"believes himself. Either way, time to shove the madman back into his hole. "
"With his own engine driving."

